{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00669","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 惟新舞 · 刘晏","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 惟新舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉祚惟永，神功中兴。\n风驱氛祲，天覆黎蒸。\n三光再朗，庶绩其凝。\n重熙累洽，景命是膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘晏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}